  "duration_s": 334.830998,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "二零零八年八月十五号，北京奥运女排小组赛，中国队对美国队哨声一响，满场中国人喊的不是加油，是郎平。你对得起谁？他站在对面教练席面无表情，最后美国队赢了。那天晚上，他手机炸说信一条，接一条全是骂他的，说他胳膊肘往外拐，说他忘了自己姓姓么么。他在在中国中国挣钱，在美国花最难听的直接骂他吃里扒外，他一条一条，看完没回，但你知道吗？就在三年前，他刚做完一次大手术，膝盖里的髌骨整个摘掉。医生说你这腿以后能正常走路就不错了。他偏不故事得从一九八一年说起。那年，郎平二十一岁东京体育馆，中国女排对日本全场日本观众嘘声。震天，日本教练在场边做鬼脸主教练袁伟民。赛前只说了一句话，全国人民都看着了，拿不下来，后悔一辈子。第五局郎平跳起来一记中扣球砸在对方场地里。解说员宋师雄扯着嗓子喊，铁榔头，一锤一个雷霆三比二，中国队赢了中国三大球第一个世界冠军。那天晚上，多少人家的收音机开着，多少人哭了，随后是五连冠，中国女排成了一个时代的符号，可代价是什么？二十五岁的郎平，膝盖磨损的像七十岁的老人，髌骨软骨膜没了，脖子以下做过几十次手术训练的时候，木屑扎进掌心，他拿胶布一缠，接着练。一九八六年，他打不动了，退役，按理说，五连冠的功臣安排个体委副主任的位置，舒舒服服过完后半辈子，没人说半个不字，领导也确实找他谈了，官位都摆到桌上，他拒绝了。他说我不是当官的料，我想去学点真东西，一个人拎着箱子自费去美国留学。在国内她是国民女神，扣球动作印在邮票上，粉丝来信能堆满一屋子。到了美国没人认识他。为了挣学费，他去排球夏令营哄小孩子打球，去小俱乐部打业余比赛。有一次膝盖软骨碎了，关节里全是基叶，腿，弯都弯不下来，队医把基叶抽出来，他咬着牙上场打一局，抽一次就这么熬了。八年，在美国总算站稳了。大房子，有了工作，有了，女儿也五岁了。后来一九九五年一个电话打过来，中国女排跌到世界第八了，不是输几场球的事儿，是新金气。没了主力队员，年纪轻轻就想一队老领导袁伟民在电话里说，郎平祖国需要你，他握着话筒，沉默了三分钟，一边是美国的大房子，年薪二十万美金。五岁的女儿另一边是国内十平米的宿舍，一张单人铁床，一年工资加补贴六千两百七十块，连给女儿打长租长途电话都不够，回来是勤奋不回来，谁也挑不出毛病。他回来回国之前，她跟丈夫协议离婚，孩子房子全留给了男方。他拎着一个箱子住进了十平米的宿舍。一年以后，亚特兰大奥运会原本一盘散沙的中国女排小组赛五战全胜，一路杀进决赛，拿了银牌。姑娘们哭，他说，别哭，这块银牌比金牌还重，你以为这就完了？没有身体又垮了，只能离开。二零零五年，他接手美国女排三年时间，把世界第十的队伍带成了北京奥运银牌。然后就有了开头那一幕，二零零八年他带美国队赢了中国队，被骂成那样。他说了一句话，排球没有国界，但教练有祖国，我挣美元，不代表我忘了自己是谁。故事讲到这，你你可能会问，被全中国骂成这样，他还会再回来吗？换做是你，你会吗？他的选择下集告诉你，如果你也被这股劲打动了，点个赞，收藏起来，转发给身边的老朋友。关注我，下集更狠，他用一个冠军堵了所有人的嘴。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00001",
      "start_ms": 110,
      "end_ms": 2130,
      "text": "二零零八年八月十五号，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00002",
      "start_ms": 2790,
      "end_ms": 4930,
      "text": "北京奥运女排小组赛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00003",
      "start_ms": 5550,
      "end_ms": 8650,
      "text": "中国队对美国队哨声一响，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00004",
      "start_ms": 9270,
      "end_ms": 11390,
      "text": "满场中国人喊的不是加油，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00005",
      "start_ms": 11630,
      "end_ms": 12290,
      "text": "是郎平。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00006",
      "start_ms": 13290,
      "end_ms": 14310,
      "text": "你对得起谁？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00007",
      "start_ms": 14910,
      "end_ms": 17310,
      "text": "他站在对面教练席面无表情，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00008",
      "start_ms": 17310,
      "end_ms": 18870,
      "text": "最后美国队赢了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00009",
      "start_ms": 18870,
      "end_ms": 20190,
      "text": "那天晚上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00010",
      "start_ms": 20190,
      "end_ms": 23110,
      "text": "他手机炸说信一条，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00011",
      "start_ms": 23110,
      "end_ms": 24770,
      "text": "接一条全是骂他的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00012",
      "start_ms": 24770,
      "end_ms": 26430,
      "text": "说他胳膊肘往外拐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00013",
      "start_ms": 26430,
      "end_ms": 29130,
      "text": "说他忘了自己姓姓么么。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00014",
      "start_ms": 29270,
      "end_ms": 30640,
      "text": "他在在中国中国挣钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00015",
      "start_ms": 30640,
      "end_ms": 35020,
      "text": "在美国花最难听的直接骂他吃里扒外，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00016",
      "start_ms": 35100,
      "end_ms": 36120,
      "text": "他一条一条，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00017",
      "start_ms": 36120,
      "end_ms": 37280,
      "text": "看完没回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00018",
      "start_ms": 38220,
      "end_ms": 39200,
      "text": "但你知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00019",
      "start_ms": 39820,
      "end_ms": 41000,
      "text": "就在三年前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00020",
      "start_ms": 41560,
      "end_ms": 43640,
      "text": "他刚做完一次大手术，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00021",
      "start_ms": 44100,
      "end_ms": 46680,
      "text": "膝盖里的髌骨整个摘掉。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00022",
      "start_ms": 47920,
      "end_ms": 54220,
      "text": "医生说你这腿以后能正常走路就不错了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00023",
      "start_ms": 54580,
      "end_ms": 58120,
      "text": "他偏不故事得从一九八一年说起。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00024",
      "start_ms": 58680,
      "end_ms": 59060,
      "text": "那年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00025",
      "start_ms": 59060,
      "end_ms": 61555,
      "text": "郎平二十一岁东京体育馆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00026",
      "start_ms": 61850,
      "end_ms": 65370,
      "text": "中国女排对日本全场日本观众嘘声。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00027",
      "start_ms": 65450,
      "end_ms": 65965,
      "text": "震天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00028",
      "start_ms": 66550,
      "end_ms": 70535,
      "text": "日本教练在场边做鬼脸主教练袁伟民。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00029",
      "start_ms": 70940,
      "end_ms": 72475,
      "text": "赛前只说了一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00030",
      "start_ms": 72920,
      "end_ms": 74440,
      "text": "全国人民都看着了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00031",
      "start_ms": 74520,
      "end_ms": 75255,
      "text": "拿不下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00032",
      "start_ms": 75640,
      "end_ms": 76715,
      "text": "后悔一辈子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00033",
      "start_ms": 77410,
      "end_ms": 82995,
      "text": "第五局郎平跳起来一记中扣球砸在对方场地里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00034",
      "start_ms": 83870,
      "end_ms": 86025,
      "text": "解说员宋师雄扯着嗓子喊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00035",
      "start_ms": 86760,
      "end_ms": 87485,
      "text": "铁榔头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00036",
      "start_ms": 87820,
      "end_ms": 90115,
      "text": "一锤一个雷霆三比二，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00037",
      "start_ms": 90520,
      "end_ms": 94725,
      "text": "中国队赢了中国三大球第一个世界冠军。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00038",
      "start_ms": 95620,
      "end_ms": 96380,
      "text": "那天晚上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00039",
      "start_ms": 96460,
      "end_ms": 98385,
      "text": "多少人家的收音机开着，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00040",
      "start_ms": 98730,
      "end_ms": 99765,
      "text": "多少人哭了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00041",
      "start_ms": 100280,
      "end_ms": 101405,
      "text": "随后是五连冠，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00042",
      "start_ms": 101850,
      "end_ms": 105055,
      "text": "中国女排成了一个时代的符号，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00043",
      "start_ms": 105620,
      "end_ms": 107045,
      "text": "可代价是什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00044",
      "start_ms": 108600,
      "end_ms": 109965,
      "text": "二十五岁的郎平，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00045",
      "start_ms": 110510,
      "end_ms": 113045,
      "text": "膝盖磨损的像七十岁的老人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00046",
      "start_ms": 113650,
      "end_ms": 115345,
      "text": "髌骨软骨膜没了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00047",
      "start_ms": 115660,
      "end_ms": 119550,
      "text": "脖子以下做过几十次手术训练的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00048",
      "start_ms": 119710,
      "end_ms": 121525,
      "text": "木屑扎进掌心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00049",
      "start_ms": 122260,
      "end_ms": 123695,
      "text": "他拿胶布一缠，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00050",
      "start_ms": 124230,
      "end_ms": 124725,
      "text": "接着练。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00051",
      "start_ms": 126500,
      "end_ms": 127545,
      "text": "一九八六年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00052",
      "start_ms": 128420,
      "end_ms": 129375,
      "text": "他打不动了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00053",
      "start_ms": 130490,
      "end_ms": 131165,
      "text": "退役，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00054",
      "start_ms": 132290,
      "end_ms": 133105,
      "text": "按理说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00055",
      "start_ms": 134690,
      "end_ms": 139850,
      "text": "五连冠的功臣安排个体委副主任的位置，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00056",
      "start_ms": 139910,
      "end_ms": 141950,
      "text": "舒舒服服过完后半辈子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00057",
      "start_ms": 141950,
      "end_ms": 143345,
      "text": "没人说半个不字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00058",
      "start_ms": 143800,
      "end_ms": 145525,
      "text": "领导也确实找他谈了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00059",
      "start_ms": 145870,
      "end_ms": 147085,
      "text": "官位都摆到桌上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00060",
      "start_ms": 147630,
      "end_ms": 148325,
      "text": "他拒绝了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00061",
      "start_ms": 149300,
      "end_ms": 152415,
      "text": "他说我不是当官的料，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00062",
      "start_ms": 152960,
      "end_ms": 154685,
      "text": "我想去学点真东西，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00063",
      "start_ms": 155210,
      "end_ms": 159195,
      "text": "一个人拎着箱子自费去美国留学。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00064",
      "start_ms": 160060,
      "end_ms": 162015,
      "text": "在国内她是国民女神，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00065",
      "start_ms": 162470,
      "end_ms": 164775,
      "text": "扣球动作印在邮票上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00066",
      "start_ms": 165100,
      "end_ms": 167215,
      "text": "粉丝来信能堆满一屋子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00067",
      "start_ms": 167770,
      "end_ms": 169845,
      "text": "到了美国没人认识他。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00068",
      "start_ms": 170480,
      "end_ms": 171500,
      "text": "为了挣学费，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00069",
      "start_ms": 171680,
      "end_ms": 174760,
      "text": "他去排球夏令营哄小孩子打球，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00070",
      "start_ms": 174920,
      "end_ms": 176995,
      "text": "去小俱乐部打业余比赛。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00071",
      "start_ms": 177660,
      "end_ms": 179345,
      "text": "有一次膝盖软骨碎了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00072",
      "start_ms": 179840,
      "end_ms": 181280,
      "text": "关节里全是基叶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00073",
      "start_ms": 181740,
      "end_ms": 181980,
      "text": "腿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00074",
      "start_ms": 182000,
      "end_ms": 183080,
      "text": "弯都弯不下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00075",
      "start_ms": 183440,
      "end_ms": 184940,
      "text": "队医把基叶抽出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00076",
      "start_ms": 185100,
      "end_ms": 187420,
      "text": "他咬着牙上场打一局，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00077",
      "start_ms": 187420,
      "end_ms": 188900,
      "text": "抽一次就这么熬了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00078",
      "start_ms": 188900,
      "end_ms": 189360,
      "text": "八年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00079",
      "start_ms": 189780,
      "end_ms": 191260,
      "text": "在美国总算站稳了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00080",
      "start_ms": 192120,
      "end_ms": 192720,
      "text": "大房子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00081",
      "start_ms": 192720,
      "end_ms": 194320,
      "text": "有了工作，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00082",
      "start_ms": 194320,
      "end_ms": 194740,
      "text": "有了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00083",
      "start_ms": 195420,
      "end_ms": 196660,
      "text": "女儿也五岁了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00084",
      "start_ms": 197620,
      "end_ms": 200660,
      "text": "后来一九九五年一个电话打过来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00085",
      "start_ms": 202120,
      "end_ms": 205520,
      "text": "中国女排跌到世界第八了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00086",
      "start_ms": 206480,
      "end_ms": 208360,
      "text": "不是输几场球的事儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00087",
      "start_ms": 208360,
      "end_ms": 210050,
      "text": "是新金气。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00088",
      "start_ms": 210070,
      "end_ms": 212150,
      "text": "没了主力队员，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00089",
      "start_ms": 212150,
      "end_ms": 217330,
      "text": "年纪轻轻就想一队老领导袁伟民在电话里说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00090",
      "start_ms": 217910,
      "end_ms": 219970,
      "text": "郎平祖国需要你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00091",
      "start_ms": 220250,
      "end_ms": 221290,
      "text": "他握着话筒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00092",
      "start_ms": 221430,
      "end_ms": 222610,
      "text": "沉默了三分钟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00093",
      "start_ms": 222990,
      "end_ms": 224990,
      "text": "一边是美国的大房子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00094",
      "start_ms": 225270,
      "end_ms": 226850,
      "text": "年薪二十万美金。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00095",
      "start_ms": 227270,
      "end_ms": 231390,
      "text": "五岁的女儿另一边是国内十平米的宿舍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00096",
      "start_ms": 232010,
      "end_ms": 233490,
      "text": "一张单人铁床，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00097",
      "start_ms": 233970,
      "end_ms": 237750,
      "text": "一年工资加补贴六千两百七十块，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00098",
      "start_ms": 237750,
      "end_ms": 240780,
      "text": "连给女儿打长租长途电话都不够，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00099",
      "start_ms": 240940,
      "end_ms": 243625,
      "text": "回来是勤奋不回来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00100",
      "start_ms": 243990,
      "end_ms": 245455,
      "text": "谁也挑不出毛病。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00101",
      "start_ms": 245900,
      "end_ms": 248555,
      "text": "他回来回国之前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00102",
      "start_ms": 248920,
      "end_ms": 250445,
      "text": "她跟丈夫协议离婚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00103",
      "start_ms": 250820,
      "end_ms": 253625,
      "text": "孩子房子全留给了男方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00104",
      "start_ms": 254500,
      "end_ms": 258005,
      "text": "他拎着一个箱子住进了十平米的宿舍。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00105",
      "start_ms": 258640,
      "end_ms": 259435,
      "text": "一年以后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00106",
      "start_ms": 259830,
      "end_ms": 266275,
      "text": "亚特兰大奥运会原本一盘散沙的中国女排小组赛五战全胜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00107",
      "start_ms": 266740,
      "end_ms": 268045,
      "text": "一路杀进决赛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00108",
      "start_ms": 268320,
      "end_ms": 269105,
      "text": "拿了银牌。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00109",
      "start_ms": 269730,
      "end_ms": 270495,
      "text": "姑娘们哭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00110",
      "start_ms": 270780,
      "end_ms": 271165,
      "text": "他说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00111",
      "start_ms": 272320,
      "end_ms": 272865,
      "text": "别哭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00112",
      "start_ms": 273820,
      "end_ms": 276445,
      "text": "这块银牌比金牌还重，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00113",
      "start_ms": 277640,
      "end_ms": 278860,
      "text": "你以为这就完了？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00114",
      "start_ms": 278920,
      "end_ms": 280855,
      "text": "没有身体又垮了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00115",
      "start_ms": 281200,
      "end_ms": 281965,
      "text": "只能离开。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00116",
      "start_ms": 282440,
      "end_ms": 283420,
      "text": "二零零五年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00117",
      "start_ms": 283680,
      "end_ms": 287175,
      "text": "他接手美国女排三年时间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00118",
      "start_ms": 287450,
      "end_ms": 290995,
      "text": "把世界第十的队伍带成了北京奥运银牌。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00119",
      "start_ms": 291570,
      "end_ms": 294480,
      "text": "然后就有了开头那一幕，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00120",
      "start_ms": 294580,
      "end_ms": 297755,
      "text": "二零零八年他带美国队赢了中国队，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00121",
      "start_ms": 298650,
      "end_ms": 299565,
      "text": "被骂成那样。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00122",
      "start_ms": 299900,
      "end_ms": 300840,
      "text": "他说了一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00123",
      "start_ms": 301260,
      "end_ms": 302880,
      "text": "排球没有国界，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00124",
      "start_ms": 303160,
      "end_ms": 304540,
      "text": "但教练有祖国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00125",
      "start_ms": 305440,
      "end_ms": 306340,
      "text": "我挣美元，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00126",
      "start_ms": 306660,
      "end_ms": 308600,
      "text": "不代表我忘了自己是谁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00127",
      "start_ms": 308740,
      "end_ms": 309680,
      "text": "故事讲到这，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00128",
      "start_ms": 309800,
      "end_ms": 311580,
      "text": "你你可能会问，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00129",
      "start_ms": 311600,
      "end_ms": 313260,
      "text": "被全中国骂成这样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00130",
      "start_ms": 313360,
      "end_ms": 314700,
      "text": "他还会再回来吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00131",
      "start_ms": 315480,
      "end_ms": 316380,
      "text": "换做是你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00132",
      "start_ms": 316600,
      "end_ms": 317260,
      "text": "你会吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00133",
      "start_ms": 318060,
      "end_ms": 320260,
      "text": "他的选择下集告诉你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00134",
      "start_ms": 321420,
      "end_ms": 323540,
      "text": "如果你也被这股劲打动了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00135",
      "start_ms": 323900,
      "end_ms": 324560,
      "text": "点个赞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00136",
      "start_ms": 326360,
      "end_ms": 327240,
      "text": "收藏起来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00137",
      "start_ms": 327460,
      "end_ms": 329395,
      "text": "转发给身边的老朋友。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00138",
      "start_ms": 329730,
      "end_ms": 330250,
      "text": "关注我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00139",
      "start_ms": 330430,
      "end_ms": 331250,
      "text": "下集更狠，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfc401eb3c58695b_s00140",
      "start_ms": 332130,
      "end_ms": 334725,
      "text": "他用一个冠军堵了所有人的嘴。"
    }
  ],
